Third-party mechanisms
----------------------
The inference subsystem independently implements mechanisms whose design
follows DeepSeek V4.1 (MIT), ds4.c (MIT), DeepSpec (MIT), vLLM (Apache-2.0)
and ZCode (Apache-2.0). No upstream code, weights or data are included. The
upstream license texts and the provenance table are in LICENSES/.
